canvas 520 280
label "Proposal lifecycle: an edit becomes a local patch, then a signed pull request, CI runs the lint gates without a model, a human reviews (highlighted) and merges, the site rebuilds and deploys, and the ledger is derived from git history"
caption "The highlighted human review is the only gate that can publish; the dashed return is a change request, which starts a new proposal."
box edit 16 40 110 44 "edit an item|human or agent"
box patch 156 40 110 44 "propose:|local patch"
box pr 296 40 110 44 "pull request|+ sign-off"
box ci 296 130 110 44 "CI lint gates|(no model)"
box rev 156 130 110 44 "human review" acc
box merge 16 130 110 44 "merge → rebuild|+ deploy"
box ledger 156 210 250 40 "ledger derived from git, head published"
arrow edit patch
arrow patch pr
arrow pr ci
arrow ci rev
arrow rev merge
arrow merge ledger
arrow rev edit dashed via=141,107;71,107
note "nobody writes to the published branch directly; a human ratifies every change"
